  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collective Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Movimiento 24 de Diciembre (M24D) will strengthen community organization in five areas vulnerable to flood and sewage overflow in the city of Paysand. These low-income neighborhoods will develop strategic planning and enhance their management capacity in order to improve their participation in the dialogues about access to decent housing, neighborhood improvements and a healthy environment. The project will benefit 280 people directly and another 6,000 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
